+#### Step 4 — Create the fixture and the helper functions `[LOCAL-WRITE]`
+
+**Do:** (bash; keep this terminal open for Steps 5-15)
+
+```bash
+[ ! -e /tmp/d09 ] || echo "STOP: remove /tmp/d09 first"
+mkdir -p /tmp/d09/home /tmp/d09/proj
